    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Fixed window frequency match</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/substring-with-concatenation-of-all-words/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 30</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Substring with Concatenation of All Words</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">It is Find All Anagrams with words instead of letters. All words have the same length w, so cut s into words at each offset 0 .. w-1 and slide a word-level window with a hash map of counts: add a word on the right, drop words on the left while one is over-used, reset on a word that is not in the list. O(n · w) time, O(k · w) space.</p>\n"
  },
